<title>BRAZIL: Brazil CS sugar output to July 1 - Unica.</title>
<headline>Brazil CS sugar output to July 1 - Unica.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results to July 1 of the 1997/98 sugar harvest in Brazil's centre-south region were as follows, said Unica, which has replaced the Association of Sugar and Alcohol Industries of Sao Paulo (AIAA).</p>
<p>					   1997/98	     1996/97</p>
<p>					01/07    16/06     01/07    16/06</p>
<p>SUGAR CANE(million tonnes)    64.77    47.19     65.20    47.27</p>
<p>SUGAR(million tonnes)	    2.45     1.74	2.50     1.72</p>
<p>ALCOHOL(million cubic meters)  3.45     2.58	3.23     2.32</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
